author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 14:51:35 -0600
subject: fix(db): WAL checkpoint TRUNCATE -> PASSIVE to stop event-loop hang

TRUNCATE blocks the event loop waiting for all readers and truncates the
WAL file, freezing 9router after ~2 days of traffic. PASSIVE flushes what
it can without blocking and never truncates. Applied to the periodic 60s
timer, gracefulClose, and the public checkpoint() method.

